  <preface xml:id="preface">
    <title>How to Use This Guide</title>
    <p>
      This is not a textbook. Our required text is
      <em>Game Theory in Action</em> by Stephen Schecter and Herbert Gintis. In these notes, we
      expand on the reading by adding in interactive games, concept check questions, and additional analysis
      of some things in the reading.
    </p>
   
  </preface>

